      "content": "it just feels like there's no point in trying to \"feel better\" anymore. i've been running on empty for years and now that he's gone, the silence is just deafening. it feels like i was just waiting for this to happen so i could finally stop. everything is just... heavy. like i'm just meant to be exhausted.",
